{% call s.prose({ width: "narrow" }) %}
  <h2>About Superbills and reimbursement</h2>
  <p>We provide a Superbill at every session: an itemized receipt you can submit to your PPO insurance for out-of-network reimbursement. To be clear, we don't bill your insurance for you, and we can't promise what they'll reimburse, since that depends on your specific plan. Many PPO plans reimburse a meaningful portion of out-of-network care. It's worth a quick call to your insurer to ask about your out-of-network mental health benefits.</p>
  <h2>Sliding scale, payment, and cancellations</h2>
  <p>A limited sliding scale is available on request, handled quietly between you and your therapist. We accept cash, check, Venmo, Zelle, and all major credit cards. We ask for 24 hours' notice to change or cancel a session, since a reserved hour that goes unused can't be given to someone else on short notice; without that notice, the full session fee applies.</p>
  <p>Still have questions about what to expect? Our full FAQ page is on the way, and in the meantime the free call is the best place to ask anything at all.</p>
{% endcall %}

